    "text": "From my own experience, I have a relative with mental health issues, the body begins to reject whatever medication you are on and it does not work as intended. The meds have to be changed from time to time to find one that works as before and it will be a while for the body to begin to reject that one too. It is a constant battle, and it is a bit of a hit and miss experimentation until they find a new med, just the way it works.",
